- op: discuss  # 985d
  at: '2026-04-07T06:19:59Z'  # 985d
  by: agent  # 985d
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 985d
  clock: 3  # 985d
  nonce: 985d  # 985d
  message: "Fixed in PR #2739. Added symbols_by_short_name multi-valued index in link_routes_to_handlers, then in _resolve_go_handler prefer candidates whose path equals the route's source file (same-file disambiguation). Verified end-to-end on real prometheus: GET /query and POST /query now resolve to web/api/v1/api.go:API.query:method instead of cmd/promtool/unittest.go:query:function. Pending bakeoff confirmation."  # 985d
