  message: "Confirmed by deep-20260407-030917 prometheus reflect agent: 'INV-kunam fix is CONFIRMED WORKING. Both GET /query and POST /query route nodes now have exactly one routes_to edge targeting web/api/v1/api.go:502-569:API.query:method. The prior session's misrouting to cmd/promtool/unittest.go:611-632:query:function is gone: that promtool helper has only 1 incoming edge (a same-file calls from testGroup.test), no routes_to. Verified by direct hg.json inspection.' Forward slice from main now reaches API.query plus 24 other web/api/v1/api.go symbols. new_feature_score went from 60 to 72; dimension_scores.slice_quality: 4. Verdict PARTIALLY_USEFUL HIGH IMPROVING. PR iterabloom/hypergumbo#2739 (commit 0732769611)."  # be70
